# make test: hold Right for 0.5 s (about 30 frames, 2 pixels each), a picture, then Esc
# (no `wait` right after a key: a line printed within about 20 ms of a key event can be
# missed by it; the --expect lines of the Makefile check the output instead)
0 wait DOT: start
+500 key right 500
+800 shot
+200 {esc}
